  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Risk-Informed Early Action Partnership Secretariat is the new partnership to expand early action financing and improve early warning systems and the capacity to act on the risks identified. This will save lives and protect livelihoods and improve the efficiency and effectiveness of response.</narrative>
